结论：**FAIL**。审查对象为 `card/w9-lint@947ef206…`，当前 `vault_lint.py` SHA-256=`6b1e573d…`。裁定 **0 BLOCKER + 3 HIGH + 8 MEDIUM + 1 LOW**。round-10 的 H1/H2/H3 与 M1–M4 均为 **REGRESSED**。

## BLOCKER

无。

## HIGH

1. **H1 REGRESSED：容器前缀仍被破坏，`~~~lang\`` 也没有按声明报出 A 孤儿。**

   位置：[vault_lint.py:351](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:351)、[vault_lint.py:390](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:390)、[test_vault_lint.py:1284](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/tests/unit/test_vault_lint.py:1284)。

   反例：

   ```md
   <!-- AUTO-GENERATED by .claude/scripts/sync_board_concepts.py source -->
   - ~~~text
     <!-- /AUTO-GENERATED -->
     [[A]]
     ~~~
   ```

   原文 mdit 为 list 内 `fence [1,5]`；但 `- ` 不是前导空白，当前实现把整行改成列 0 `<!--x-->`，且不记 anomaly。真实 CLI：

   ```text
   rc=0, status=ok, orphans=[], inbound_targets=1, blind_spots=0
   ```

   `~~~lang\`` 同样得到：

   ```text
   rc=2, status=warn, orphans=[], inbound_targets=1
   ```

   因而“随段盲化、A 报孤儿”不成立。新增门的名称/docstring 写 A 应报孤儿，但 [test_vault_lint.py:1300-1305](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/tests/unit/test_vault_lint.py:1300) 实际断言 `subjects == []`，锁定了相反极性。

2. **H2 REGRESSED：NESS 子例通过，但 END 边界和 fence 深度泄漏仍成立。**

   位置：[vault_lint.py:346-348](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:346)、[vault_lint.py:383-389](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:383)。

   `(?=$|\s|-->|-)` 允许任意连字符后缀：

   ```md
   <!-- AUTO-GENERATED by .claude/scripts/sync_board_concepts.py source -->
   <!-- /AUTO-GENERATED-NESS -->
   [[A]]
   ```

   输出：

   ```text
   rc=0, status=ok, orphans=[], inbound_targets=1
   ```

   Fence 内 END 也仍能让 fence closer 后、真实 END 前的链接泄漏：

   ```md
   <!-- AUTO-GENERATED ... -->
   ~~~text
   <!-- /AUTO-GENERATED -->
   ~~~
   [[A]]
   <!-- /AUTO-GENERATED -->
   ```

   输出为 `rc=2, warn, orphans=[], inbound_targets=1`，直接证伪“泄漏方向已闭”。[test_vault_lint.py:1308-1357](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/tests/unit/test_vault_lint.py:1308) 只覆盖 `NESS` 和“存在任一 note”，未覆盖上述路径。

3. **H3 REGRESSED：实体同基代码未落地，token-wide 集合碰撞仍在。**

   位置：[vault_lint.py:414-431](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:414)、[vault_lint.py:482-495](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/scripts/vault_lint.py:482)、[test_vault_lint.py:1326-1338](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w9-lint/backend/tests/unit/test_vault_lint.py:1326)。

   当前文件没有 `import html` 或 `html.unescape`。实跑：

   ```text
   [[X&#65;]] \[\[X&\]\]
   → rc=2, orphans=['节点/XA.md'], inbound_targets=1

   `[[A]]` \[\[A\]\]
   → rc=0, orphans=[], inbound_targets=1
   ```

   新实体门反而明确断言 `XA.md` 应继续报孤儿，与本轮声明相反。Docstring 所称“逐 match 绑定”也不实：实现仍是 token 行区间的 `raw_targets` 集合加 membership。

   此外，声明中的 Python `html.unescape` 也不严格等同 mdit：

   ```text
   html.unescape('A&amp') = 'A&'
   mdit unescapeAll('A&amp') = 'A&amp'
   ```

   直接采用该转换器仍会产生新的同名错误授权。

